      "ArticleTitle": "Effects of single nanoinjections of Met-enkephalin in the minimally anesthetized rat brainstem on trigeminal nuclear neurons: differential effects on spontaneous versus evoked activity and noci-evoked versus innocuously-evoked responses.",
